# AI Basics

'''
AI	--> Machines performing tasks that normally require human intelligence

ML	--> Machine learns patterns from data

Deep --> Learning	ML using neural networks

Generative AI	--> AI that generates text, images, code, etc.

LLM	--> Large Language Model such as GPT, Claude , Microsoft Copilot .

Prompt	--> Instructions you give to an AI model.

Embedding	--> Converting text into numbers so computers can compare meaning.

Vector --> DB	Database used to search similar meanings.

RAG	--> Give an LLM information from your own documents/data.

AI Agent	--> AI that can reason, use tools, retrieve data and perform actions.

Fine-tuning	--> Training/adapting a model for a specific task.

```

